(5741732, 835381, 42256, '<td valign="top">Nice textures in the liquid and good take at the challenge.  IMO the background is not adding anything to the shot, I would have preferred the frame filled with just these layers! 6</td>', 'Nice textures in the liquid and good take at the challenge.  IMO the background is not adding anything to the shot, I would have preferred the frame filled with just these layers! 6', '2009-11-25 14:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
