(5741735, 835500, 42256, '<td valign="top">Great take at the challenge, I am guessing you are being hammered for DNMC though.. I like the water and clouds showing up the cycle.. I wish it was a closer crop and a little more saturation! 6</td>', 'Great take at the challenge, I am guessing you are being hammered for DNMC though.. I like the water and clouds showing up the cycle.. I wish it was a closer crop and a little more saturation! 6', '2009-11-25 14:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
