(5741750, 835380, 107027, '<td valign="top">I''m sure that I''m missing something here but I just didn''t get it.  I marked your shot a 4.  The blur of the plant in the top right was a bit distracting as well as the papers going over the border line.  Also, the colors seem a bit subdued and the words are not too sharp.  <br/> <br/>I hope some of this info is useful to you, I look forward to seeing more of your work!</td>', 'I''m sure that I''m missing something here but I just didn''t get it.  I marked your shot a 4.  The blur of the plant in the top right was a bit distracting as well as the papers going over the border line.  Also, the colors seem a bit subdued and the words are not too sharp.   I hope some of this info is useful to you, I look forward to seeing more of your work!', '2009-11-25 14:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
