(5741757, 834734, 42256, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, composition and focus could have been better.  A closer crop and greater dof would have really helped this shot! 6</td>', 'Nice subject, composition and focus could have been better.  A closer crop and greater dof would have really helped this shot! 6', '2009-11-25 14:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
