(5742362, 835335, 111474, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more detail in the left hand side and a little less light on the teath as they look washed out. (Plus it needs a dust :))</td>', 'I would like to see more detail in the left hand side and a little less light on the teath as they look washed out. (Plus it needs a dust :))', '2009-11-25 22:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
