(5742368, 835358, 111474, '<td valign="top">I love the sparks off the finger, but the 2 washed out strands on the left could be removed. I would have also liked to see more of the finger.</td>', 'I love the sparks off the finger, but the 2 washed out strands on the left could be removed. I would have also liked to see more of the finger.', '2009-11-25 23:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
