(5743885, 835492, 83080, '<td valign="top">Chromite Smoothie anyone?  Creative composition &amp; lighting for this style of shot, although I wish the angles were larger to make the tilting effect feel a little more deliberate rather than just off balance.</td>', 'Chromite Smoothie anyone?  Creative composition & lighting for this style of shot, although I wish the angles were larger to make the tilting effect feel a little more deliberate rather than just off balance.', '2009-11-27 14:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
