(5743892, 835304, 83080, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I''m really curious how many takes before you captured this one. I assume you were able to reuse the same broken light &amp; just kept replacing the filament, but I''ve never tried this sort of thing.  Looks fun &amp; worth trying.</td>', 'Awesome!  I''m really curious how many takes before you captured this one. I assume you were able to reuse the same broken light & just kept replacing the filament, but I''ve never tried this sort of thing.  Looks fun & worth trying.', '2009-11-27 14:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
