(5745567, 835127, 69450, '<td valign="top">I''m not particularly mathematically/scientifically inclined; however, I don''t see the element representative of Pi in this photo.  When I think of Pi I think of circles and spheres.  Bubbles are spheres, but don''t make an appearance in this photo.  That said, I''m not voting based on your title.  Would have liked a slightly slower shutter speed to prevent the highlight blow-outs, or better yet - assuming you didn''t use one - a ND filter.  5<br/> <br/>EDIT: by "slower" I meant "faster"  OOPS</td>', 'I''m not particularly mathematically/scientifically inclined; however, I don''t see the element representative of Pi in this photo.  When I think of Pi I think of circles and spheres.  Bubbles are spheres, but don''t make an appearance in this photo.  That said, I''m not voting based on your title.  Would have liked a slightly slower shutter speed to prevent the highlight blow-outs, or better yet - assuming you didn''t use one - a ND filter.  5 EDIT: by "slower" I meant "faster"  OOPS', '2009-11-29 13:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5745640, 835246, 327, '<td valign="top">Just a bit more focus and this would of been a winner. Right on target for the challenge.</td>', 'Just a bit more focus and this would of been a winner. Right on target for the challenge.', '2009-11-29 14:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
