(5749422, 834787, 88580, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> You may have gotten slammed with a lot of low votes, but look at all the high ones and a very high commenter''s average. I gave it a 9. One of those entries with strong appeal for a narrow group, which makes for a success in my book. I''m pleased to find out it was yours. Congrats on the Posthumous blue, it deserved it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks.  I was pleased with it, but I didn''t expect it to score well.  I am quite astounded by how well it was received by some, though.<br/> <br/>eta: The only thing that would have made this better is if I had placed 69/69.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-02 00:12:38.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: You may have gotten slammed with a lot of low votes, but look at all the high ones and a very high commenter''s average. I gave it a 9. One of those entries with strong appeal for a narrow group, which makes for a success in my book. I''m pleased to find out it was yours. Congrats on the Posthumous blue, it deserved it.   Thanks.  I was pleased with it, but I didn''t expect it to score well.  I am quite astounded by how well it was received by some, though. eta: The only thing that would have made this better is if I had placed 69/69.', '2009-12-02 00:11:36.000000', '2009-12-02 00:12:38.000000', 0),
