(5749430, 835433, 37845, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jeger:</b></div><hr/><i> This is my final round entry for the MS Side Tournament. I am up against my best friend 21.gif VitaminB. We''ve decided to split the prize money. All that remains is bragging rights :P  </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Woohooo... bragging rights are mine :P</td>', 'Originally posted by jeger: This is my final round entry for the MS Side Tournament. I am up against my best friend 21.gif VitaminB. We''ve decided to split the prize money. All that remains is bragging rights :P    Woohooo... bragging rights are mine :P', '2009-12-02 00:15:14.000000', NULL, 0),
