(5749521, 834360, 52549, '<td valign="top">You''re so right, Lydia. Too soon is always to soon.... So sorry about your Dad ;-( he was blessed with a great daughter, though! Big (((Hugs))) and congrats on the ribbon. Super image.</td>', 'You''re so right, Lydia. Too soon is always to soon.... So sorry about your Dad ;-( he was blessed with a great daughter, though! Big (((Hugs))) and congrats on the ribbon. Super image.', '2009-12-02 00:52:43.000000', NULL, 0),
