(5749735, 834360, 86799, '<td valign="top">I am sorry for your loss, but glad for your relationship with your dad.  That is wonderful.<br/>I am going, today, to be with my sister as she goes through some big dangerous surgery.  And be sure, I WILL tell her I love her before she goes in.  <br/>We appreciate your words, and love this pic, too!  God bless.</td>', 'I am sorry for your loss, but glad for your relationship with your dad.  That is wonderful.I am going, today, to be with my sister as she goes through some big dangerous surgery.  And be sure, I WILL tell her I love her before she goes in.  We appreciate your words, and love this pic, too!  God bless.', '2009-12-02 05:27:05.000000', NULL, 0),
