(5750260, 834360, 61315, '<td valign="top">So sorry for your loss Lydia. I wish I had been able to have that kind of relationship with my father but he passed away at the age of 47. You are so lucky to have so many wonderful memories.<br/>Congrats on your ribbon - brings back memories of biology - but, fortunately, your frog has a much happier ending! :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-02 11:49:54.</i></td>', 'So sorry for your loss Lydia. I wish I had been able to have that kind of relationship with my father but he passed away at the age of 47. You are so lucky to have so many wonderful memories.Congrats on your ribbon - brings back memories of biology - but, fortunately, your frog has a much happier ending! :-)', '2009-12-02 11:48:53.000000', '2009-12-02 11:49:54.000000', 0),
